    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property is delighted to bring to the market No. 57 Woodville Manor, Tom Bellew Avenue, Dundalk. This is a well-presented 3 bedroom semi-detached home located in an established estate just minutes from Dundalk town centre.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal location for anyone looking for real convenience. Within easy walking distance you have Dundalk Retail Park, The Marshes Shopping Centre, Tesco, Omniplex Cinema, DKIT Sports Complex & Swimming Pool, plus DKIT Institute of Technology and of course two primary schools and one secondary school nearby. Everything you need for everyday living right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThe home itself offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout and in move in condition. This property will suit first-time buyers, a young family or anyone looking to relocate closer to town from a rural setting.\r\n\r\nOutside the property really shines. There is off-street parking to the front with side access, leading to a detached garage, all facing south and fully walled in. A perfect space to enjoy the sun for most of the day and perfect for entertaining children or simply relaxing.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to secure a home in a sought-after location with minimal effort required. Early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nFor all further details and to arrange a viewing, contact Blue Sky Property on 042-9329333. Guide Price €277,500. \r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
